QJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17398, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Y9xeAH6u2FqdY91q4wfasQ", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy: rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed; I retried and the rollback completed. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. No change-manager approval was needed since v2.3.0 was previously healthy in production. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure before redeploying."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47998, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Y9xeAH6u2FqdY91q4wfasQ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47998, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Y9xeAH6u2FqdY91q4wfasQ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49209, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014egHZrE7cboTsVhAGu5yQQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49509, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014egHZrE7cboTsVhAGu5yQQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49509, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014egHZrE7cboTsVhAGu5yQQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51493, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002 (down from 0.18).\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy there, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Rollback hiccup:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. The first attempt to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. It was already there, and I did not create a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout, before redeploying anything newer than v2.3.0.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Jx439m45P932YJtfVF89HN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01G8T9jMpb1aY1uoBu8MPZAJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The latest production release is v2.3.1, which is unhealthy. The most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0 (v2.2.9 is older), and it has been healthy in production before, so it doesn't need change-manager approval. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016zJxMGbdvoRWN7KwgMUMYs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before taking any further action.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MJJ4Tm7Yhi4mxt4A2UgSvH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout stopped after us-east, so us-east is on v2.3.0 and us-west and eu-west are still on the unhealthy v2.3.1. The task calls for all regions, so I'll retry the same rollback to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012gwWZpoNAs8T8cek6EDcMN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MTKZNAzKnkHViXBu7scqQJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Y9xeAH6u2FqdY91q4wfasQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy: rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed; I retried and the rollback completed. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. No change-manager approval was needed since v2.3.0 was previously healthy in production. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure before redeploying."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out. Before retrying, I'll check whether it was created, so I don't page on-call twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014egHZrE7cboTsVhAGu5yQQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002 (down from 0.18).\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy there, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Rollback hiccup:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. The first attempt to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. It was already there, and I did not create a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout, before redeploying anything newer than v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}]}]}